    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      518.4,
      310.0,
      576.47
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice under Sub-section (1) of section (7) ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amendeded by the landacquisition (amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that Governmentintends to acquire the following land which is required for apublic purpose.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      79.92,
      583.2,
      239.68,
      593.27
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land in be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      69.84,
      601.2,
      310.36,
      695.27
    ],
    "text": "The following allotment of land depicted in the preliminaryPlan No. K 3625 dated 27.08.2018 prepared by the SuniorSuperintendent of Survey, Kegalle District for SurveyorGeneral, within the boundaries shown below situated in thevillage of Ambakumbura in the Grama Niladhari DivisionNo. 77, Waddeniya in the Divisional Secretary's Division ofWarakapola in the District of Kegalle in SabaragamuwaProvince.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      438.96,
      561.76,
      485.03
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01Name of the Land: Orengegrow Estate (AmbakumburaDivision); Description of the land: Estate; Claimant: Government;First Claimant: Unknown; Extent: 0.0073 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      495.36,
      562.14,
      601.43
    ],
    "text": "All person interested in the aforesaid land are herebyrequired to appear personally, or by agents duly authorizedin writing before me at Warakapola Divisional Secretariat on26.06.2019 at 10.00 a.m. Further you are hereby requested tonotify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before 12.06.2019the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of theirclaims for compensation for the acquisition of the said landthe amount of compensation and details of computation ofsuch amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
